                              <p> <font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2"> 
                               <b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b>&nbsp;Input as 
                                much information as possible, a simple or advanced 
                                search should be performed to confirm that the 
                                event in question has not yet been input.</font></p>
                              <ul>
                                <li><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 
