                                  or advanced search must be performed. Click 
                                  on the date of the desired event and the Data 
                                  Center will display all existing details. Click 
                                  on &#8220;Edit&#8221; to perform the necessary 
                                  changes, then click on &#8220;Save&#8221;.</font></li>
                                <li><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 
                                  To <strong>delete</strong> an event, follow 
                                  the same search procedure as previously described. 
